# Rules of Reactor

Coming soon — this page is the rules-and-idioms reference: hook
ordering, render purity, mutation pitfalls, the common anti-patterns
that the analyzers (`REACTOR_FUNC_*`, `REACTOR_PERSIST_*`,
`REACTOR_GRID_*`) catch automatically. Reactor's "Rules of React"
equivalent. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Hooks](hooks.md) covers the hook ordering rule and
[Components](components.md) covers render purity.
